ide  | EN · RU · ES\nDistributed  | EN · RU · ES\nEcosystem  | EN · RU · ES\nResearch  | EN · RU · ES\nWiki  | Home · Quick Start · FAQ\nLanding page  | Live demo · docs/landing/index.html · deploy guide\nChangelog  | CHANGELOG.md · RELEASE.md\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nmetis/docs/en/README.md at main · alexar76/metis · GitHub (https://github.com/alexar76/metis/blob/main/docs/en/README.md)\nciteturn63search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday;     pip install \"aimarket-metis[dev,distributed]\"\n\n# Metis — User Guide\n\nMetis (μῆτις) — counsel, wisdom, deep thought. A distributed cognitive layer over any LLM.\n\nMulti-agent reasoning orchestrator — councils, MoA, tools, MCP, verification, and production security. See NAMING.md for etymology and API conventions.\n\n## Quick start\n    \n    cd metis\n    python3 -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate\n    \n    # PyPI\n    pip install \"aimarket-metis[dev,distributed]\"\n    \n    # or editable from clone\n    pip install -e \".[dev,distributed]\"\n    \n    # Ollama (local, free)\n    ollama pull qwen3:8b\n    metis \"Explain multi-agent systems\" --model qwen3:8b --url http://localhost:11434/v1\n    \n    # OpenAI (set key first)\n    export METIS_API_KEY=sk-...\n    metis \"Your question\" -c config.production.yaml --production\n\nFull docs below: Architecture · API · Research evidence · Security · Distributed · Economy · Ecosystem · Research digest\n\nMetis is API-only — no bundled chat UI. Serve with `metis-serve` and integrate via VS Code Continue, Cursor, or `curl` (`POST /v1/chat/completions`).\n\nPer-module model config (`modules:` in YAML) — see ARCHITECTURE.md:\n    \n    metis config validate -c config.yaml\n    metis config show-modules -c config.yaml\n    metis-serve -c config.yaml --port 8080\n\n## What is metis?\n\nA single LLM makes one interpretation of your task. Metis wraps any model with a multi-agent cognitive stack:\n\n  * Understanding Council — parallel diverse agents → structured `TaskSpec`\n  * Confidence gate — fail-closed before expensive solve paths\n  * Layered Mixture-of-Agents (MoA) — propose → refine → aggregate\n  * Agent loop — plan, act, observe, reflect with tools + MCP\n  * Verifier — judge checks answer against task contract\n  * Economy layer — usage metering, cost attribution, budget gates\n  * Production security — prompt injection defense, SSRF, rate limits\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\naicom/docs/ecosystem/knowledge-base.md at main · alexar76/aicom · GitHub (https://github.com/alexar76/aicom/blob/main/docs/ecosystem/knowledge-base.md)\nciteturn63search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; See the proof without installing anything: AIMarket Playground sends one allow-listed GAIA reading through Hub, asks Metis for verification, checks the signed Hub receipt against the origin key, and links the run to Alien Monitor. ... Consumed by Metis and ARGUS via the aimarket-web preset. · https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-mcp\nGAIA  | `gaia/`  | gaia  | iot-physical-oracles.md\nATLAS  | `atlas/`  | atlas  | atlas/docs/GUIDE.md · atlas.modelmarket.dev\nARGUS-3  | `argus/`  | argus  | wp §3.7 · wiki\nAlien Monitor  | `alien-monitor/`  | alien-monitor  | wp §3.8 · UNI / LIVE\nACEX  | `acex/`  | acex  | wp §3.10\nLottery  | `lottery/`  | lottery  | wp §3.11\nDIOSCURI  | `dioscuri/`  | dioscuri  | landing · integration · setup\nTHEOROS  | `theoros/`  | theoros  | landing · integration · CANON.md\nHELIOS  | `helios/`  | helios  | integration · runbook\nMetis  | `metis/`  | metis  | integration · ECOSYSTEM.md · PyPI `aimarket-metis`\nLOGOS  | `logos/`  | logos  | README · federation analytics, anomaly detection, AI assistant\n\n## 6. SDKs & client libraries\n\nPackage  | Install  | Use\n--- | --- | ---\n`aimarket-agent` (PyPI)  | `pip install aimarket-agent`  | Python consumer\n`aimarket-bridges` (PyPI)  | `pip install