tools it calls during the conversation: the agent reads their description, decides to use them and gets the result back. AIMarket MCP Gateway is listed under Security, a category of 133 servers in the directory, where it ranks #127 by stars.\n\nTopics declared by the repository: `aicom`, `aimarket`, `fetch`, `python`, `web-search`.\n"
